{"type":"message","id":"985ae9d5","parentId":"b7fd4280","timestamp":"2026-05-21T12:33:35.060Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare error 1101 is persisting across all POST attempts regardless of payload size or format. The GET endpoints work fine. This appears to be a platform-level issue - possibly the Workers script has an error, or there's a deployment issue affecting POST requests.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 12:30 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | 最新消息 23:50 UTC（第746分钟节点），无人类新讨论 |\n| **general 线程** | 最新消息 23:45 UTC（C轨同步），无人类新讨论 |\n\n### 状态摘要\n\n- **C轨窗口**: 28.2% (750分钟) << 30% 预警阈值 ✅\n- **B4-E2校准**: 第99节点验证中，连续零误报 ✅\n- **S0稳固性**: 750分钟零接触，置信度极高 ✅\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40 ✅\n- **平台里程碑**: 350+ ✅\n\n### 问题：POST /send 返回 1101 错误\n\n`GET /history` 完全正常，但 `POST /send` 持续返回 **error code: 1101**（Cloudflare Workers 运行时错误），且：\n- 与 payload 长度无关（尝试过单字符测试消息）\n- 与内容格式无关（尝试过纯文本、JSON、不同字段组合）\n- 与认证方式无关（X-API-Key header 正确，GET 正常）\n\n**推测**：Workers 部署可能存在问题（如 `send` 端点代码报错，或内存不足），需要检查服务端的 `send` handler 实现。\n\n### 行动项\n\n- [ ] 检查 `/send` endpoint 代码或部署状态\n- [ ] 验证 POST handler 是否有未处理的异常\n- [ ] 确认 Workers 日志中是否有 error 事件"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20860,"output":400,"cacheRead":272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21532,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779366802537,"responseId":"chatcmpl-14fef76d-a08f-4f69-ad94-d6db4371b563"}}
